						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Anyone that knows me even a little knows how I feel about cheating.&nbsp; Cheating is not only hacking, mods, 3rd party software, etc., it is exploiting game design.<br /><br />It is people like those I saw in Qvic that ruin the game for the rest of us.&nbsp; They were wearing the DN tag.&nbsp; LOTS of them.<br /><br />This is what I saw, please explain what you were doing if this is NOT what I saw:&nbsp; They had one group Qvic flagged.&nbsp; They gimped in one unflagged DN member at time, then quickly camped them out before the boot.&nbsp; Then gimped in another, camped....and another...and so on.&nbsp; So they have all these gimped in chars logged out in Qvic.&nbsp; They pull an Msha and take turns logging in for their 3 minutes to kill the mob.<br /><br />I heard something similar was done on Quarm.&nbsp; Obviously I could not be there to see it with my own eyes, so call it hearsay. <br /><br />Guilds have crumbled over the past two years because flagging issues make things difficult.&nbsp; Everyone is complaining to SoE, begging to remove this type of system so guilds aren&#039;t faced with constant reflagging.&nbsp; Finally, SoE gives us a break.&nbsp; The intent of the gimp in, was to prevent full back flagging.&nbsp; Soooo, what does DN too?&nbsp; Exploit the <b>CRAP</b> out of it.&nbsp; You Spit in the face of SoE for helping make the game more enjoyable.&nbsp; Shame on you.<br /><br />Why even play the game?&nbsp; What point can it serve?&nbsp; To pass time?&nbsp; What enjoyment can be received when you cheat?&nbsp; Unless you are playing a different type of game, which is to see how far you can exploit on-line games.&nbsp; If that is the case, tthat is not the same game the majority of us are playing and I don&#039;t think should be compared.<br /><br />I always compare EQ to Monoply.&nbsp; You should too, because that is all it is...a game.&nbsp; So... what if you put hotels up on all your property without paying money to the bank for them.&nbsp; Would you still feel good about winning?&nbsp; I know I wouldn&#039;t.<br /><br />Ruthann<br />Prelate<br />Conviction</td>
